      Signal dispatcher that routes to setup_rt_frame or compat_setup_rt_frame based on is_compat_task(). No FDPIC check or gp-reload logic exists here. This is the natural place to add FDPIC-aware pre-signal gp fixup (reload gp from the handler's function descriptor) before delegating to the frame-setup functions, which are currently buggy for the FDPIC case.
